"provider":"anidb","id":"17984","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165790","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55887","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"230189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433584","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"86122","synopsis":"Takuya vuole tornare a casa a Kumamoto nel fine settimana per dire alla sua famiglia che il matrimonio è fasullo. Prima, però, deve fare da accompagnatore a una principessa europea che vuole trascorrere una giornata a Tokyo in incognito.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1Aqj3KehvCu8pvlfBvJxArrZS0C.jpg"},{"title":"Possiamo condividere le nostre vite?","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17984","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165790","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55887","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"230189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433584","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"86316","synopsis":"Secondo il piano, Takuya dovrebbe tornare dai suoi familiari da solo e confessare loro che la storia del matrimonio è una bugia, ma le circostanze costringono Rika ad accompagnarlo.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fXvrJjZzaQIt4EeVNTA4aJmKcCf.jpg"},{"title":"Che ne dici di viaggiare insieme?","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17984","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165790","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55887","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"230189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433584","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"86408","synopsis":"Il viaggio ad Aso sembra pieno di intoppi, ma finalmente la famiglia di Takuya viene informata che il matrimonio è fasullo. Il secondo giorno procede come una normale gita, ma le sorprese non sono finite...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1URGtI8PXCWFCku0g9ca9PHVVxj.jpg"},{"title":"Due persone sono felici insieme?","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17984","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165790","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55887","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"230189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433584","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"86503","synopsis":"Tornati a Tokyo, Rika e Takuya non sanno più come comunicare tra loro. Un evento inaspettato nella vita di Shinshi dimostrerà loro che le difficoltà possono essere in agguato anche nei matrimoni apparentemente più felici.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y3BGfrtJSdsodtupJrD5BgzMGLZ.jpg"},{"title":"Can I Come Over to Your Place?","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17984","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165790","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55887","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"230189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433584","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"86598","synopsis":"Nao happens upon Rika on her first day in Tokyo. While the two of them are hanging out, Rika expresses frustration over how noncommittal Takuya tends to be, so Nao takes the liberty of ordering Takuya to pay a visit to Rika's apartment.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iVjbBLPwqVx5AqDoWsl0SgTXXWa.jpg"},{"title":"Are Declarations of Love Genuine?","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17984","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165790","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55887","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"230189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433584","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"86693","synopsis":"Gonda drops by unannounced and asks for Takuya's help. He's about to meet someone from a dating app in real life for the first time, and he needs a wingman to help ensure things don't go sideways. But it's not exactly a date...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jB2WLaZ5x1QWZZpCHFLZIPEVcMB.jpg"},{"title":"Rika-san, How Are You?","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17984","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165790","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55887","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"230189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433584","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"86769","synopsis":"Nao recommends Rika try out glassmaking as a form of stress management. But it isn't long before a stressor from the past reenters Rika's life, and this leads her to take a thorough look at where things now stand between her and Takuya.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jrS8IeH0UcmPaLPkcVfVld8eOGH.jpg"},{"title":"Are You Okay With Dating?","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17984","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165790","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55887","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"230189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433584","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"86911","synopsis":"Rika rather abruptly invites Takuya on a date, and what she has in mind is unconventional to say the least. What's her actual goal for the day, and what happens if things don't play out the way she envisions?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hBO7VcPyCKv5hEeNyPK1d0nedvL.jpg"},{"title":"Are You Serious About Living Under the Same Roof?","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17984","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165790","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55887","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"230189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433584","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"87010","synopsis":"Kurokawa gives a new work assignment to Rika and Takuya, one that living together for a time would make it easier to complete. But as they soon discover, that would mean having to sort out quite the bevy of details.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jycfyUaf6B6eDx7G4mjpaVKg3Ny.jpg"},{"title":"Are You Really Getting Married?","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17984","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"165790","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55887","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"230189","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"433584","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"87154","synopsis":"The time has finally come to choose someone for the Alaska transfer. Takuya and Rika might be safe provided everyone believes their fake marriage plan, but once somebody goes in their place, will they be able to live with the guilt?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/on0qIx2fluFEXUBV3spcaJGi6Xb.jpg"}],